meta {
  name: Get Last Wash
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/wash/last/:vehicle_id
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:path {
  vehicle_id: ab8b8d0e-d74d-11ed-afa1-0242ac120002
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get Last Wash

  This request is used to get last wash history by given `vehicle_id`. This request interacts with the MySQL database, and has a protected routes.

  ## Path Parameters

  | Name       | Type   | Required | Description | Example                               |
  |------------|--------|----------|--------------|------------------------------------------|
  | vehicle_id | string | yes      | Vehicle ID  | ab8b8d0e-d74d-11ed-afa1-0242ac120002   |

  ## Responses

  **200 — Wash fetched successfully**
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "wash fetched",
    "data": {
      "wash_desc": "Cuci mobil",
      "wash_by": "Carwash",
      "is_wash_body": 1,
      "is_wash_window": 1,
      "is_wash_dashboard": 1,
      "is_wash_tires": 1,
      "is_wash_trash": 1,
      "is_wash_engine": 1,
      "is_wash_seat": 1,
      "is_wash_carpet": 1,
      "is_wash_pillows": 0,
      "wash_address": "AutoService Jl. Kapten Tandean",
      "is_fill_window_washing_water": 0,
      "is_wash_hollow": 1,
      "created_at": "2024-03-27 12:33:05"
    }
  }
```

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
```

  **404 — wash failed to fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "wash history not found"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}